{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣G奶女星熊熊（卓毓彤）3年前閃婚，隔年生下一女鈮霓，今年5月她宣布懷有第二胎，原本預產期是12月初，因胎兒成長狀況良好，於日前（23日）提前開刀迎接兒子出世，成功湊個「好」字，她也在社交平台晒出有青筋和妊娠紋的孕肚照，引來網民心疼她懷孕</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T18:23:47.738659+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T18:01:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T18:16:56.908148+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T18:16:56.908148+00:00","content_hash":"c5a5dda825f016a0707f446284ab294d828362c165a17f9bed2688e69010377b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}